[2026-11-03T20:29:16.550Z] [STDERR] # Agent workflow guide
[2026-11-03T20:29:16.555Z] [STDERR] This guide explains how an AI coding agent (or a person) picks, plans,
[2026-11-03T20:29:16.557Z] [STDERR] implements, verifies and hands off work in this monorepo. Start at
