[2026-11-03T20:58:26.117Z] [STDERR] # Links UI dev mode extension
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.119Z] [STDERR] Private workspace: not published to npm or a browser store. Run:
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.126Z] [STDERR] ```bash
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.137Z] [STDERR] npm run build --workspace @link-foundation/ui-devmode-extension
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.139Z] [STDERR] ```
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.141Z] [STDERR] Requires `zip` on PATH. The script builds the shared dev mode bundle, writes
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.142Z] [STDERR] `dist/unpacked/{manifest.json,background.js,devmode.js}` and
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.146Z] [STDERR] `dist/ui-devmode-extension.zip`. In Chromium, open `chrome://extensions`, enable
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.155Z] [STDERR] Developer mode, click Load unpacked and choose `dist/unpacked`.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.165Z] [STDERR] Visit a regular HTML page and click the toolbar action (pin it if necessary).
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.166Z] [STDERR] Select a title, open Properties, edit text and style color. Reload the page and
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.172Z] [STDERR] click the action again: both changes return. The action toggles an open inspector.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.179Z] [STDERR] Copy overrides as LiNo and Copy subtree as LiNo provide the migration artifacts.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.181Z] [STDERR] Changes are saved in `chrome.storage.local`, isolated by origin and pathname.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.185Z] [STDERR] The action grants `activeTab`; `scripting` injects the packaged `devmode.js` in
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.186Z] [STDERR] an isolated world. `storage` saves the LiNo. No broad host permissions are used.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.187Z] [STDERR] Unlike the bookmarklet, extension script injection works under page script CSP,
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.189Z] [STDERR] including `packages/ui-devmode/tests/fixtures/foreign-csp.html`. Internal browser
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.193Z] [STDERR] pages, extension store pages, and other restricted targets are unsupported.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.200Z] [STDERR] Cross-origin iframe content and closed shadow roots are not traversed.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.203Z] [STDERR] The automated `foreign.e2e.mjs` test loads this unpacked folder in a persistent
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.213Z] [STDERR] Chromium context, activates the actual action handler through its service worker,
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.214Z] [STDERR] and verifies edits, storage, reload and strict CSP. This uses a test-only host
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.219Z] [STDERR] grant to simulate the activeTab grant Chrome supplies on a real toolbar click.
[2026-11-03T20:58:26.225Z] [STDERR] To verify manually, serve the repository, open the CSP fixture, click the toolbar
